		<!--
			Media Center plays its own audio out over HDMI rather than through
			Control4's DIGITAL_AUDIO. Declaring that is what allows media metadata and
			transport controls - including the Now Playing progress bar - to render on
			remote-class devices such as the Neeo, and its successor the Halo.
		-->
